      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p25_b10",
      "text": "natural test is therefore whether the robust objective can exploit a proxy ranking that is\ncorrect but not perfectly calibrated.\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
